Mrs. Colombo gave birth to a seven -pound, 12 -ounce bouncing baby boy.

428
00:21:34,420 --> 00:21:36,140
Look! It's your dad!

429
00:21:36,960 --> 00:21:38,280
Oh, and mine.

430
00:21:39,820 --> 00:21:42,320
The newest Colombo was delivered by Dr.

431
00:21:42,400 --> 00:21:45,320
Jason Siever, who is, of all things, a psychiatrist.

432
00:21:45,320 --> 00:21:48,720
We asked him what it was like to deliver a baby at 30,000 feet.

433
00:21:49,000 --> 00:21:50,840
Well, Storks had been doing it for years.

434
00:21:52,780 --> 00:21:54,740
Hi, Mom. Hi, Mike.

435
00:21:54,900 --> 00:21:58,360
Hi, Maggie. Hey, if you think this is news, wait till I get home.

436
00:22:00,000 --> 00:22:03,900
It worked. Mike's going to college.

437
00:22:04,580 --> 00:22:07,540
Oh, great. He gets to be on TV, too.

438
00:22:09,280 --> 00:22:13,600
Thank you. Thank you.

439
00:22:14,340 --> 00:22:16,760
