I look good.

442
00:22:22,900 --> 00:22:24,160
Well, should I rewind it?

443
00:22:24,460 --> 00:22:27,220
No, no. I think three times is enough for one afternoon.

444
00:22:29,120 --> 00:22:32,780
Well, honey, you know, when I see how good you look on television, you know what

445
00:22:32,780 --> 00:22:33,480
