447
00:22:35,940 --> 00:22:40,100
Oh. No, I think you'd be great on television.

448
00:22:40,200 --> 00:22:41,560
Did it ever occur to you?

449
00:22:42,260 --> 00:22:44,840
Maggie, I'm perfectly happy doing what I'm doing.

450
00:22:45,000 --> 00:22:46,920
Well, just a lot.

451
00:22:49,480 --> 00:22:53,400
Ah. Here's Jason.

452
00:22:55,860 --> 00:23:29,540
Nah. I'm gonna be a good boy.

453
00:23:29,600 --> 00:23:29,680
I'm gonna be a good boy.

454
00:23:29,880 --> 00:23:30,040
I'm gonna be a good boy.

